{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:718","content":{"id":718,"title":"多数元素","content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"b223cda8-fd20-4bf2-acdc-7f458610fbae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"题目描述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a038aa6-3940-46ba-a72f-de673392719c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"给定一个大小为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"n"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的数组 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"nums"},{"type":"formatted","text":" ，返回其中的多数元素。多数元素是指在数组中出现次数大于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"⌊n/2⌋"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的元素。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6e746122-5dcb-4dad-a87d-77a42205b99c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"你可以假设数组是非空的，并且给定的数组总是存在多数元素。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"","uuid":"8afe50b9-167e-4794-a571-3803c0a73a06","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"52f57c7e-6e3c-44c3-8e90-0d1177d3e54a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"示例 1：\n输入：nums = [3,2,3]\n输出：3\n\n示例 2：\n输入：nums = [2,2,1,1,1,2,2]\n输出：2","collabId":"0820f052-29b3-451d-8f62-83facaf689d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d8defd52-0540-41a5-ae1b-8c6c818e81f7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"提示："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"6a7fbbef-92d6-4fd9-a885-aec55e6cc11f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"47bf2f8c-2017-445f-98f1-8e148715dc25","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0d200b7d-4cee-4ed3-a5e7-b04e274ade9b","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"n == nums.length"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"35bd2894-49e7-47b3-b0ba-ca6b2e22a8aa","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"247464d3-40a6-48df-9ada-03a8df9d4d08","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"1 <= n <= 5 * 10^4"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"4584f730-c1fb-4a4a-a387-ccac8a6d3f9e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"94ea86d2-f279-468a-aac8-8062827f7321","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-10^9 <= nums[i] <= 10^9"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5b033be-f8c1-4e07-960e-b5df93e982f1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进阶：尝试设计时间复杂度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(n)","collabId":"6c0d193e-9a00-4e80-9637-cff4098b9ef8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(n)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"、空间复杂度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(1)","collabId":"09bde95c-b7e9-4e83-8ada-3e1efb9d3f70","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(1)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的算法解决此问题。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"043dd622-1726-4652-82ab-916793da8513","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解题思路"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"be425a9a-351d-48f8-b2f1-a2877ab7fc68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"遍历数组时使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Map"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 记录每个元素出现的次数，当有元素超过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"⌊n/2⌋ "},{"type":"formatted","text":"时，返回该元素。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"ts","uuid":"4b7d4073-aaed-4ff2-9390-eebe6e46b87d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d3fc9d72-9ee2-4c06-8e57-7dc2406468e6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function majorityElement(nums: number[]): number {\n    const l = nums.length;\n    if (l <= 1) return nums[0];\n\n    const n  = Math.floor(l / 2);\n    const map = new Map();\n\n    for (const num of nums) {\n        const count = map.get(num);\n        if (!count) {\n            map.set(num, 1);\n        } else {\n            map.set(num, count + 1);\n            if (count + 1 > n) return num;\n        }\n    }\n};","collabId":"66bcf3a9-c61c-4340-bd4b-100d7d701a24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"220ff291-1dc9-4131-8937-e3849921a3a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Map"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的空间复杂度为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"O(n)","collabId":"17c098a7-8bc6-48fe-8b06-53dc962e3859","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"O(n)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，是否可以使用一个变量就可以实现记录，可以将整个过程看作是守擂，每次遍历元素就相当于挑战擂主，如果和擂主相同，则一起站在擂台上，由于一定有一个多数元素，因此最后站在擂台上的一定是多数元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"ts","uuid":"728b80e0-c7b7-46f6-bce4-2d6dca408b82","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7a98828e-067a-47ab-9057-c95cefbc2969","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function majorityElement(nums: number[]): number {\n    // 擂台上的人数\n    let votes = 0;\n    // 擂主\n    let ret;\n    for (const num of nums) {\n        // 擂台上没人\n        if (votes === 0) ret = num;\n        votes += (num === ret ? 1 : -1);\n    }\n\n    return ret;\n};","collabId":"763d2cd8-eb2f-4cd9-9588-bce852704121","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4309de7b-ad04-498a-9b5f-f2de20cfc15e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"数组"},{"label":"多数元素","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}}],"nextPage":{"title":"除自身以外数组的乘积","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:720","type":"doc","id":720}},"createTime":1729090774814,"updateTime":1744296252841,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1744296252841}}